# T91 setup (row I191): one song played to its end (a finished play) and one replaced before its end (a skip),
# written to the history table by the engine's own writer, the way userdata.sel does for T78.
OPEN selecta-test.mod
PLAY
@render_until_end
OPEN selecta-test-mk.mod
PLAY
@render 1024
OPEN selecta-test.mod
